The JSON Schema files under ap2/ and ucp/ in this directory are copied verbatim from the Agent
Payments Protocol reference implementation:

    https://github.com/google-agentic-commerce/AP2
    code/sdk/schemas/

They are redistributed here under the Apache License, Version 2.0, the licence of that project.
A copy of the licence is available at http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

They are vendored rather than fetched at runtime so that conformance checking works offline and in
CI, and so that the exact schema revision Dwarpal was built against is recorded in this repository.
No modifications have been made to their contents. That includes leaving the few non-ASCII
characters upstream uses in its descriptions, which the rest of this repository avoids: editing
them would mean these are no longer verbatim copies.

